(What it is) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(A single-page, music-synced demoscene web app built with Vite + TypeScript, Canvas 2D, and Web Audio API.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(It plays a curated timeline of visual effects, transitions, and text cues over a soundtrack.) Tj
0 -15 Td
0 -15 Td
/F2 12 Tf
(Who it is for) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(Primary persona: a demo creator/editor who wants to author or tweak audio-timed effect sections for a browser-based show.) Tj
0 -15 Td
0 -15 Td
/F2 12 Tf
(What it does) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(- Runs a full-screen intro + section timeline with per-section effects, transitions, layering, and text cues.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(- Synchronizes visuals to audio features \(RMS/bass/mid/treble/beat\) and supports manual beat injection via canvas taps.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(- Supports many built-in effects plus WebGL2 effects with automatic Canvas2D fallback when WebGL2 is unavailable.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(- Provides debug/editor controls, quality presets, framing modes, and URL-based rendering/performance tuning.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(- Tracks live view counts using /api/views with GET/POST handling and KV-backed persistence when configured.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(- Includes community workflows for submitting doodles and AI-generated effect ideas with moderation/review endpoints.) Tj
0 -15 Td
0 -15 Td
/F2 12 Tf
(How it works \(repo-evidenced architecture\)) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(- Frontend app: src/main.ts wires canvas/UI, loads timeline config, initializes AudioPlayer, Timeline, and Renderer.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(- Config layer: src/config/loadConfig.ts validates/normalizes raw JSON \(audio, intro, sections, layers, transitions, cues\).) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(- Playback core: src/timeline/timeline.ts computes intro/section mode, active transition windows, and active text cues by time.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(- Audio analysis: src/audio/audioPlayer.ts uses Web Audio analyser data to emit beat + band energy features each frame.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(- Rendering: src/renderer/renderer.ts and effect registry modules render the selected effect stack and transition blending.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(- Service endpoints: api/views.ts, api/doodles.ts, api/effects.ts expose JSON APIs; they use createKvClients\(\) for persistence.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(- Data flow: timeline.release.json + song.mp3 -> load/normalize -> frame loop reads audio+time -> timeline state -> renderer output.) Tj
0 -15 Td
0 -15 Td
/F2 12 Tf
(How to run \(minimal\)) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(1\) Install Node.js 18+.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(2\) Run: npm install) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(3\) Run: npm run dev) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(4\) Open the local Vite URL and press Start.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(5\) Optional: replace public/song.mp3 and edit public/timeline.release.json for custom timing/effects.) Tj
ET
